# Harness installs written by running the CLI from inside this package during
# manual verification. Never source — one such run committed 65 files.
#
# NOTE: the codex adapter writes AGENTS.md, a legitimate filename that cannot
# be ignored here. Do not run `jig install --agent codex` from inside this
# repo; it will shadow the real root AGENTS.md with generated, stale content.
/.agents/
